\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb100\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb6\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\sl240\slmult1\f1\fs24\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Tips\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 using\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw-2 FlowCom:\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri845\sl244\slmult1\sb237\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 The FlowCom can also calculate CFM based on readings which you must \'93type\'94 into it.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Typing into the FlowCom (basically pressing buttons like a hand calculator) is cumbersome and really is not even necessary.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 The Port Flow Analyzer is really only using the FlowCom to read pressures, temperatures, barometer and possibly swirl or tumble.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 It does not use the FlowCom\'92s Range settings, leakage #, test pressure or flow direction (except for SF 1020 benches).\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Therefore, you do not need to make any changes to\expnd2\expndtw8  \expnd0\expndtw0 the FlowCom during the running of a test.\expnd13\expndtw66  \expnd0\expndtw0 The program is notifying you of difference between the FlowCom\expnd16\expndtw80  \expnd0\expndtw0 settings\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 and\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 program\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 settings\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 mostly\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 to explain\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 why\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 FlowCom\'92s\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 CFM\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 may\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 not\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 match\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 what\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 program\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 is\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 calculating.\expnd8\expndtw40  \f6\b1\i1\expnd0\expndtw0 If\i1  the program\'92s entries and flow bench specs are correct, then the CFM recorded by the program is correct.\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery725\footery743\margtsxn1100\margbsxn940\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb66\f6\fs24\b1\i1\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li806\sl240\slmult1\f1\fs24\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Tips\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 using\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 FlowCom,\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw-2 cont:\par
